{"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.057613169352213528,"y":0.098837209159615358,"c":1,"x":0.12962962921278212,"t":"Test 4"},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.14244186032314565,"x":0.12962962352174362,"w":0.29012346903483072,"t":"READING PASSAGE 3"},{"y":0.17427258461076078,"w":0.7759189351399739,"h":0.022532697841612825,"c":1,"x":0.1295492321457066,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading"},{"w":0.16049382527669268,"t":"Passage 3 below.","x":0.12962963042400319,"c":1,"y":0.19464075410030324,"h":0.016195524146054074},{"y":0.22495705579966119,"h":0.026489278031743391,"w":0.58458368937174487,"c":1,"t":"Environmental practices of big businesses","x":0.23034564931705384},{"t":"The environmental practices of big businesses are shaped by a fundamental fact that for many of","h":0.019570837032106825,"x":0.12954071664436753,"c":1,"w":0.7759246826171875,"y":0.26448778624912972},{"h":0.020161087296736491,"c":1,"t":"us offends our sense of justice. Depending on the circumstances, a business may maximize the","x":0.12953511448236915,"y":0.2812266189391075,"w":0.75535344441731778},{"c":1,"w":0.7636024983723958,"x":0.12951466240020978,"h":0.021171995551622746,"t":"amount of money it makes, at least in the short term, by damaging the environment and hurting","y":0.29672505182193176},{"y":0.31455744029278088,"h":0.020018623630627008,"w":0.78001546223958329,"t":"people. That is still the case today for fishermen in an unmanaged fishery without quotas, and for","c":1,"x":0.12748500823649977},{"x":0.12956243622403027,"w":0.76969721476236974,"c":1,"h":0.0195412540323463,"y":0.33109390951546658,"t":"international logging companies with short-term leases on tropical rainforest land in places with"},{"h":0.018509999602085325,"w":0.76147186279296875,"t":"corrupt officials and unsophisticated landowners. When government regulation is effective, and","y":0.34837609335577335,"c":1,"x":0.12955669208846796},{"h":0.021482436199210642,"t":"when the public is environmentally aware, environmentally clean big businesses may out-compete","x":0.12951047388111173,"y":0.36405500210281627,"w":0.78421574910481773,"c":1},{"t":"dirty ones, but the reverse is likely to be true if government regulation is ineffective and if the","c":1,"y":0.38193015125221608,"x":0.1295735131213514,"w":0.74703923543294271,"h":0.019445879860957693},{"h":0.01944421963641163,"y":0.43157643894746611,"x":0.12953302441597239,"w":0.70799092610677083,"t":"It is easy for the rest of us to blame a business for helping itself by hurting other people.","c":1},{"t":"But blaming alone is unlikely to produce change. It ignores the fact that businesses are not","x":0.13161117652257304,"y":0.44840121078088457,"w":0.72444869995117189,"h":0.018497542863178618,"c":1},{"t":"charities but profit-making companies, and that publicly owned companies with shareholders","x":0.12952543069000239,"h":0.019996370106619588,"w":0.74506373087565114,"y":0.46452965698541859,"c":1},{"x":0.12954078084447929,"w":0.72446879069010417,"h":0.018819447260161382,"y":0.48182731521519573,"t":"are under obligation to those shareholders to maximize profits, provided that they do so by","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017460692757290786,"w":0.74897120157877595,"t":"legal means. US laws make a company's directors legally liable for something termedạbreach","x":0.1296296255179728,"y":0.49852767948835708},{"y":0.5143647304135035,"x":0.1295557539710443,"h":0.019345172302461799,"c":1,"t":"of fiduciary responsibility' if they knowingly manage a company in a way that reduces profits.","w":0.75527521769205741},{"w":0.73267532348632824,"c":1,"y":0.53183769066296127,"t":"The car manufacturer Henry Ford was in fact successfully sued by shareholders in 1919 for","x":0.12956670525587347,"h":0.019145505026737508},{"h":0.018366715933324618,"t":"raising the minimum wage of his workers to $5 per day: the courts declared that, while Ford's","y":0.54902222352964913,"c":1,"w":0.74910573323567697,"x":0.12957016092254076},{"y":0.56527959185554943,"h":0.020060868369957352,"t":"humanitarian sentiments about his employees were nice, his business existed to make profits for","x":0.12957702683009606,"w":0.76967010498046873,"c":1},{"y":0.58307132227042202,"t":"its stockholders.","h":0.015889032429042493,"x":0.1293518854658765,"c":1,"w":0.13641941070556646},{"y":0.61627906962046164,"h":0.015988372380376759,"w":0.76131688435872391,"c":1,"x":0.13168723678026803,"t":"Our blaming of businesses also ignores the ultimate responsibility of the public for creating the"},{"y":0.63221437011810011,"h":0.017494932361148963,"c":1,"t":"conditions that let a business profit through destructive environmental policies. In the long run, it","x":0.13168724304240537,"w":0.77572016398111976},{"h":0.020027198836435556,"y":0.64748722727763619,"w":0.78001469930013023,"c":1,"t":"is the public, either directly or through its politicians, that has the power to make such destructive","x":0.12954356034472084},{"c":1,"x":0.1295352105093561,"y":0.66488362467515882,"w":0.73266128540039066,"h":0.019110458338078118,"t":"policies unprofitable and illegal, and to make sustainable environmental policies profitable."},{"x":0.13159383297846811,"w":0.78414154052734375,"t":"The public can do that by suing businesses for harming them, as happened after the Exxon Valdez","y":0.69745158760121506,"h":0.019844760602719669,"c":1},{"x":0.13168725875038187,"w":0.76748967488606767,"y":0.71366279090056672,"h":0.018963828384525261,"t":"disaster, in which over 40,000 m' of oil were spilled off the coast of Alaska. The public may also","c":1},{"w":0.78414433797200522,"c":1,"x":0.13158789653794808,"t":"make their opinion felt by preferring to buy sustainably harvested products; by making employees","y":0.73106570413267991,"h":0.019778149428440583},{"t":"of companies with poor track records feel ashamed of their company and complain to their own","x":0.13159113835719854,"y":0.74805941791357611,"w":0.76561742146809886,"c":1,"h":0.019010685357946477},{"x":0.1315724831859228,"w":0.75742909749348963,"c":1,"t":"management; by preferring their governments to award valuable contracts to businesses with a","y":0.76450693335309827,"h":0.020170315134792061},{"t":"good environmental track record; and by pressing their governments to pass and enforce laws and","w":0.78211334228515628,"c":1,"y":0.7814032637721513,"x":0.13158334530456539,"h":0.020222966044755042},{"c":1,"t":"88","w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.13374485607023828,"y":0.91715116260773688,"h":0.013081395583944722}],"w":2400}